OL,3,AElon Musk says record $446m spending on
OL,4,AUS midterms was 'pretty foolish'       
OL,6,FElon Musk said on Wednesday that he    
OL,7,Ffelt "pretty foolish" about the record 
OL,8,Fsum he spent on the US midterm         
OL,9,Felections, following sweeping          
OL,10,FRepublican defeats.                    
OL,12,FThe Tesla and SpaceX chief executive   
OL,13,Fwas the election's top individual      
OL,14,Fdonor, giving $446m (#339m) to support 
OL,15,FPresident Donald Trump's party,        
OL,16,Fparticularly in Texas where many of    
OL,17,FMusk's firms are based.                
OL,19,FMusk, who had backed Trump's second    
OL,20,FWhite House bid, also said he was "not 
OL,21,FMaga" - the Make America Great Again   
OL,22,Fmovement associated with the president.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
