OL,3,AElon Musk says record $446m spending on
OL,4,AUS midterms was 'pretty foolish'       
OL,6,FDemocrats won control of both chambers 
OL,7,Fin the US Congress, flipping both swing
OL,8,Fseats and making historic gains in     
OL,9,Fplaces that have for decades been      
OL,10,Fcontrolled by Republicans.             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
