OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGoogle rejects UK request for Russell  
OL,4,ABrand YouTube video to be removed,     
OL,5,Asources say                            
OL,7,FThe disgraced comedian is currently in 
OL,8,Fprison after being sentenced to        
OL,9,F10-and-a-half years following his      
OL,10,Fconviction for rape and three counts of
OL,11,Fsexual assault.                        
OL,13,FGoogle told BBC News in a statement it 
OL,14,Fwas "aware of the new content and our  
OL,15,Fteams are investigating".              
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
